# CalenderJS — AI agent onboarding

Before non-trivial work, read in order:

1. `docs/llm-guide.md` — task routing, file map, implementation status
2. `TASK_TRACKING.md` — current sprint (what is pending)
3. Relevant RFC in `docs/rfc/`
4. `AGENTS.md` — pnpm-only, RFC-driven rules

Index: `llms.txt` at repo root.

## Invariants

- Calendar package: `@calenderjs/calendar` (NOT `@calenderjs/core`)
- Web component tag: `wsx-calendar`
- Event SSOT: `packages/event-model/src/Event.ts`
- Event extension field: `data`
- Package manager: `pnpm` only — never `npx`
- Tests: `pnpm --filter @calenderjs/calendar test` (vitest)

## Not implemented yet (do not assume)

- EventDataGenerator (RFC-0011)
- Calendar plugin mechanism (RFC-0012)
- RFC-0003 multi-tenant backend (DO NOT IMPLEMENT)

## Task routing

